==============================================================
Lab 3：手写迷你 MCP —— 两个真实进程之间的 JSON-RPC 对话
==============================================================

  >>> 发送: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "method": "initialize", "params": {"protocolVersion": "2024-11-05", "clientInfo": {"name": "lab3-client", "version": "0.1.0"}, "capabilities": {}}}
  <<< 收到: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 1, "result": {"protocolVersion": "2024-11-05", "serverInfo": {"name": "lab3-mini-mcp", "version": "0.1.0"}, "capabilities": {"tools": {}}}}

[握手完成] server=lab3-mini-mcp protocol=2024-11-05

  >>> 发送: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "method": "notifications/initialized"}

  >>> 发送: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "method": "tools/list"}
  <<< 收到: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 2, "result": {"tools": [{"name": "get_time", "description": "返回一个固定的演示时间戳（真实实现里这里查系统时钟）", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {}, "required": []}}, {"name": "word_count", "description": "统计一段文本的中英文字数", "inputSchema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"text": {"type": "string", "description": "待统计文本"}}, "required": ["text"]}}]}}

[能力发现] 共 2 个工具: get_time, word_count

  >>> 发送: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "get_time", "arguments": {}}}
  <<< 收到: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 3, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "2026-09-21T18:00:00+08:00（演示固定值）"}], "isError": false}}

[调用 get_time]   -> 2026-09-21T18:00:00+08:00（演示固定值）

  >>> 发送: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "word_count", "arguments": {"text": "MCP 让一个协议服务 N 个工具"}}}
  <<< 收到: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 4, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"中文\": 10, \"英文单词\": 2}"}], "isError": false}}
[调用 word_count]  -> {"中文": 10, "英文单词": 2}

  >>> 发送: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "method": "tools/call", "params": {"name": "delete_all", "arguments": {}}}
  <<< 收到: {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 5, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Error: 未知工具 delete_all"}], "isError": true}}
[调用未知工具]     -> isError=True Error: 未知工具 delete_all（协议不炸，错误也是数据）

结论：MCP = 进程隔离 + JSON-RPC 三件套；SDK 只是把这层管道包起来。
